      "content": "hey, i've been tracking something weird lately and i need help spotting a pattern. i've noticed that whenever i get these specific physical sensations, the market moves right after. like, it's almost like a signal. \n\nhere's what happened today:\n- 9:32 AM EST: sharp pressure in my inner ear, right as pre-market volatility spiked.\n- 10:14 AM EST: a heavy, dull ache in my solar plexus. right after, NVDA dropped about 2%.\n- 1:45 PM EST: sudden tingling in my fingertips. the S&P 500 hit a local bottom shortly after.\n\ncan u look at these timestamps and see if there's a correlation with the volatility or specific sector movements? i'm trying to calibrate these sensations so i can use them as an early warning system for my trades.",
